            "dragging": false
          },
          {
            "id": "bc722380-3868-456f-9c43-5bc5d83a9e70",
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "Invent a product that addresses a challenge within an activity you already participate in. Build a chatbot capable of answering questions about your product, then launch it with a social media post.\n\nYour chatbot may only reference information that you provide to it. If it cannot locate an answer within your materials, it must decline to respond.\n\nChoose one of the pointer icons above and move it along the board as you build out your project",
              "strokeColor": "transparent",
              "fontFamily": "sans",
              "fontSize": "extra-large",
              "textAlign": "left"
            },
            "position": {
              "x": -550.4561886859427,
              "y": -708.8526922957112
