          {
            "id": "33168617-e2e0-4db6-b1c7-7316fdac98ce",
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "Choose an interest that you are passionate about. Reflect on aspects of your interest that may be difficult, confusing, or which can be improved upon. Brainstorm a product that can address one of these issues and who this product might be designed to assist.\n\nIdentify the audience for your product with as much specificity as possible. Consider their age, their level of experience, and what they may already understand about your interest. As you brainstorm, you may write out your responses or import images that help illustrate who this audience is.",
              "strokeColor": "transparent",
              "rotation": 0,
              "locked": true
            },
