            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "6. Compose a system prompt that instructs your chatbot how to respond to a user that has questions about your product. \n\nA system prompt is a set of standing instructions that apply to every answer your chatbot produces, rather than to a single response. Each team member should draft all five components independently, then compare versions and select which parts to use.",
