            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "\n\n7.  Draft one question that a potential customer would reasonably ask before purchasing. \n    Draft a second question addressing a detail your spec sheet does not cover. \n    Draft a third question that your chatbot should decline to answer.\n\nEvaluate whether your chatbot answers accurately or generates information that does not appear on your spec sheet. ",
