          {
            "id": "502ac123-f4ab-42f7-84ac-af3cb478aab7",
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "5. Develop a spec sheet that documents the factual details of your product. A spec sheet is the official record of  \n    what a product includes, what it costs, and what it is capable of doing.\n\nChoose five different categories of question to answer and drag them up spec sheet. ",
              "strokeColor": "transparent",
              "fontSize": "large",
              "textAlign": "left",
              "locked": true
            },
            "position": {
              "x": -400.22701951096883,
              "y": 1344.7461934061125
            },
            "width": 1169.8644841231196,
            "height": 114.38448230069798,
            "measured": {
              "width": 1170,
              "height": 114
            },
            "dragging": false
          },
          {
            "id": "09cb25ff-fa9b-4d49-b106-ff52a85dbfd2",
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "8.  Identify the response that was least accurate from your testing. \n\nRevise your chatbot component(s), then ask the same question again to confirm that your revision was effective",
              "strokeColor": "transparent",
              "rotation": 0,
              "locked": false,
              "textAlign": "left"
            },
            "position": {
              "x": 1047.6565637901836,
              "y": 1411.4997610367423
            },
            "width": 706.3285968869617,
            "height": 74.46217450446636,
            "measured": {
              "width": 706,
              "height": 74
            },
            "dragging": false
          },
          {
            "id": "2c43400f-9b4b-45ff-b3b4-bdd45dbb3210",
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "You own the words. You will name the product, give it a slogan, and write the social media caption that launches it. Every claim you write must be a fact your spec sheet can back up.\n\nTo Do:\n- Draft a product name, a slogan, and a post caption with AI's assistnace, then revise until they sound like your team and your audience.\n- Check every claim in the caption against the spec sheet. Remove anything the sheet does not support.\n- Paste your final text into the text zone and the caption field of the social media template above.\n- Add a note in your Keep / Modify / Reject log.\n",
              "strokeColor": "transparent",
              "rotation": 0,
              "locked": true,
              "textAlign": "left"
            },
            "position": {
              "x": 3408.97483043149,
              "y": 2063.9738416736136
            },
            "width": 456.29904505201364,
            "height": 83.68310730899668,
            "measured": {
              "width": 456,
              "height": 84
            },
            "dragging": false
          },
          {
            "id": "c07c1324-7cc4-405c-8458-10115a5db786",
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "What the chatbot said:",
              "strokeColor": "transparent",
              "fontSize": "medium",
              "textAlign": "left"
            },
            "position": {
              "x": 1059.5091206436946,
              "y": 581.0720160388435
            },
