          {
            "id": "d3d375c3-68b2-401b-b97c-ea254d2abae9",
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "JOB DESCRIPTIONS (Mandatory)",
              "fontFamily": "cursive",
              "textAlign": "center",
              "fontSize": "extra-large",
              "locked": true
            },
            "position": {
              "x": 2767.7696597375525,
              "y": 1576.132357592774
            },
            "width": 811.6395624085471,
            "height": 120,
            "measured": {
              "width": 812,
              "height": 120
            },
            "dragging": false
          },
          {
            "id": "b3d9fe22-6d7e-4ae1-abf9-d40b7f535574",
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "SOCIAL MEDIA POST",
              "fontFamily": "cursive",
              "textAlign": "center",
              "fontSize": "extra-large",
              "locked": false
            },
            "position": {
              "x": 3293.09786352499,
              "y": -152.68901040275853
            },
            "width": 393.3152034379728,
            "height": 120,
            "measured": {
              "width": 393,
              "height": 120
            },
            "dragging": false
          },
          {
            "id": "70408bfd-3eb8-455f-a0c6-e45a3941da9a",
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "Your social media text goes here...\n",
              "strokeColor": "transparent",
              "rotation": 0,
              "locked": false,
              "textAlign": "left"
            },
            "position": {
              "x": 3156.9791400038403,
              "y": 799.7032582411041
            },
            "width": 671.7603094678033,
            "height": 165.4347083689113,
            "measured": {
              "width": 672,
              "height": 165
            },
            "dragging": false
          },
          {
            "id": "2e0c60bc-8ed6-405f-9519-a70ca0df22f7",
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "Copywriter",
              "fontFamily": "sans",
              "textAlign": "center",
              "fontSize": "extra-large",
              "locked": true
            },
            "position": {
              "x": 3491.2696701158975,
              "y": 1873.132357592774
            },
            "width": 253.7299661147859,
            "height": 68,
            "measured": {
              "width": 254,
              "height": 68
            },
            "dragging": false
          },
          {
            "id": "e42e291a-e917-4257-86a6-8a50bb8516e2",
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "Art Director",
              "fontFamily": "sans",
              "textAlign": "center",
              "fontSize": "extra-large",
              "locked": true
            },
            "position": {
              "x": 2822.492042844558,
              "y": 1873.1323575927738
            },
            "width": 253.7299661147859,
            "height": 68,
            "measured": {
              "width": 254,
              "height": 68
            },
            "dragging": false
          },
          {
            "id": "5d354b7c-4eff-44cb-acea-ce03ba293999",
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "You own the look. You will create the main image for the post, and a logo if time allows. Your image should match what the spec sheet says the product actually is.\n\nTo Do:\n- Create an image prompt to generate the main image for your post.\n- Check it against the spec sheet: number of parts, colors, and appearance must match. \n- Save your image to your Backpack and import it into Sketch Lab in the social media template above.\n- Add a note in your Keep / Modify / Reject log.\n",
              "strokeColor": "transparent",
              "rotation": 0,
              "locked": true,
              "textAlign": "left"
            },
            "position": {
              "x": 2753.0573474318057,
              "y": 2041.9168318708598
            },
            "width": 456.29904505201364,
            "height": 83.68310730899668,
            "measured": {
              "width": 456,
              "height": 84
            },
            "dragging": false
          },
          {
            "id": "46a89cd6-9c7d-42bd-bdf5-38f304d2358c",
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "JOB DESCRIPTIONS (Optional)",
              "fontFamily": "cursive",
              "textAlign": "center",
              "fontSize": "extra-large",
              "locked": true
            },
            "position": {
              "x": 4195.759020959755,
              "y": 1576.1323575927738
            },
            "width": 811.6395624085471,
            "height": 120,
            "measured": {
              "width": 812,
              "height": 120
            },
            "dragging": false
          },
          {
            "id": "61a282a7-52fe-4b73-8f7a-dbacaeaa99cf",
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "Sound Designer",
              "fontFamily": "sans",
              "textAlign": "center",
              "fontSize": "extra-large",
              "locked": true
            },
            "position": {
              "x": 4316.08080575294,
              "y": 1869.6501553395897
            },
            "width": 253.7299661147859,
            "height": 68,
            "measured": {
              "width": 254,
              "height": 68
            },
            "dragging": false
          },
          {
            "id": "12b8562c-c75f-451b-a40f-95249d035b22",
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "You own the sound. You will write the hook that gets stuck in people's heads, then produce it as a jingle in Music Lab.\n\nTo Do:\n- Produce a jingle in Music Lab to support your product.\n- Place a QR code screenshot in social media post template above.\n- Add a note in your Keep / Modify / Reject log.\n",
              "strokeColor": "transparent",
              "rotation": 0,
              "locked": true,
              "textAlign": "left"
            },
            "position": {
              "x": 4214.267039514515,
              "y": 1989.7938970650898
            },
            "width": 456.29904505201364,
            "height": 83.68310730899668,
            "measured": {
              "width": 456,
              "height": 84
            },
            "dragging": false
          },
          {
            "id": "56c91bb9-e2dc-48f2-ab38-80d6307ce3b2",
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "Commercial Director",
              "fontFamily": "sans",
              "textAlign": "center",
              "fontSize": "extra-large",
              "locked": true
            },
            "position": {
              "x": 5039.908076047633,
              "y": 1864.426851959813
            },
            "width": 323.374011178476,
            "height": 68,
            "measured": {
              "width": 323,
              "height": 68
            },
            "dragging": false
          },
          {
            "id": "7dbaee83-7d7f-4830-af03-9c96a42e422f",
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "You own the pitch. You will write a 15 to 30 second commercial script, words only, that sells the product without promising anything the spec sheet cannot deliver.\n\nTo Do:\n- Draft a 15 to 30 second script with AI: opening hook, the problem, the product, the price.\n- Cut any line that oversells. If the spec sheet cannot back it up, it does not air.\n- Paste your final script next to the social media post template above.\n- Add any notes in your Keep / Modify / Reject log.\n",
              "strokeColor": "transparent",
              "rotation": 0,
              "locked": true,
              "textAlign": "left"
            },
            "position": {
              "x": 4998.861258779902,
              "y": 2032.1874146353998
            },
            "width": 456.29904505201364,
            "height": 83.68310730899668,
            "measured": {
              "width": 456,
              "height": 84
            },
            "dragging": false
          },
          {
            "id": "fbd2daf2-df28-49cf-b752-e5b57361a502",
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "Community Manager",
              "fontFamily": "sans",
              "textAlign": "center",
              "fontSize": "extra-large",
              "locked": true
            },
            "position": {
              "x": 5822.932784646463,
              "y": 1862.6857508332205
            },
            "width": 337.30282019121347,
            "height": 68,
            "measured": {
              "width": 337,
              "height": 68
            },
            "dragging": false
          },
          {
            "id": "55d5d355-6631-4f2e-aa57-8073ed18b2c7",
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "You own the comments. You will predict what people will ask under the post, test those questions on your team's chatbot, and write the pinned reply.\n\nTo Do:\n- Predict the first three comments or questions your post will receive.\n- Ask your team's chatbot each one. If it invents an answer or cannot respond, tell your team so they can fix the spec sheet or the prompt.\n- Write a short pinned FAQ reply and paste it next to the social media post template above.\n- Add a note in your Keep / Modify / Reject log.\n",
              "strokeColor": "transparent",
              "rotation": 0,
              "locked": true,
              "textAlign": "left"
            },
            "position": {
              "x": 5781.167807720485,
              "y": 2039.4092275676444
            },
            "width": 456.29904505201364,
            "height": 83.68310730899668,
            "measured": {
              "width": 456,
              "height": 84
            },
            "dragging": false
          },
